<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A9806015" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Door Sash Tape Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
Wrinkle of the tape or trapping of foreign material like air under the tape spoils its appearance and adhesive strength.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
To avoid wrinkle or trapping of foreign material, prepare body surface where the tape is stuck degreasing and cleaning with white gasoline and carefully stick the tape.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9806015001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<attention2>
<ptxt>
Heated body panel by hot air drier and the hot air itself could be hot enough to get burned.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Carefully work for removal of the tape on the panel.
</ptxt>
</attention2>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Recommended heating temperature for the tape is about 60 &#176;C (140 &#176;F).
</ptxt>
</attention3>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A9806015002">
<title>
Front door
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove front door opening weather-strip if necessary. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9A06006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove front door trim, door outer and inner weather-strip referring to Step 1) – 8) of 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A9506009">Front Door Glass Removal and Installation</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove door mirror assembly. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9506020"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Detach front door glass run (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Using a hot air drier, heat front door sash tapes (2) at one side.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Peel off an edge of the heated tape and remove it parallel to the door outer panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove remaining tape in the same manner as in Step 5) – 6).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A980014.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "45.963mm" ver = "01" gw = "224" gh = "114"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A9806015003">
<title>
Rear door
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear door opening weather-strip if necessary. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9A06008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove rear door trim, door outer and inner weather-strip referring to Step 1) – 9) of 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0A9506013">Rear Door Glass Removal and Installation</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove outside door handle. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9606004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Detach rear door glass run (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Using a hot air drier, heat rear door sash tapes (2) at one side.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Peel off an edge of the heated tape and remove it parallel to the door outer panel.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A980015.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "45.963mm" ver = "01" gw = "188" gh = "114"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</topic>
</servinfosub>
